This chapter shares only roster, teammate, Team, First, Second, Third, Fourth, Fifth, Sixth, record, switch, replace, revive and capture.

Use the battle chapter.

A roster has a count (number), a selected (number), a result (text) and a notice (text).
There is a roster called Team whose count is 0 and whose selected is 1 and whose result is "" and whose notice is "".
A teammate has a starter (text), a species (text), a level (number), a experience (number), a health (number), a maximum health (number), a attack (number), a defense (number), a special (number), a speed (number), a base speed (number), a move one (text), a move two (text), a move three (text), a move four (text), a pp one (number), a pp two (number), a pp three (number) and a pp four (number).
