There is a teammate called Sixth whose starter is "", whose species is "", whose level is 0, whose experience is 0, whose health is 0, whose maximum health is 0, whose attack is 0, whose defense is 0, whose special is 0, whose speed is 0, whose base speed is 0, whose move one is "", whose move two is "", whose move three is "", whose move four is "", whose pp one is 0, whose pp two is 0, whose pp three is 0 and whose pp four is 0.
Let the members be a list of First, Second, Third, Fourth, Fifth and Sixth.

To store a member (teammate):
  Set the member's starter to Combat's starter.
  Set the member's species to Combat's species.
  Set the member's level to Combat's level.
  Set the member's experience to Combat's experience.
  Set the member's health to Combat's health.
  Set the member's maximum health to Combat's maximum health.
  Set the member's attack to Combat's attack.
  Set the member's defense to Combat's defense.
  Set the member's special to Combat's special.
  Set the member's speed to Combat's speed.
  Set the member's base speed to Combat's base speed.
  Set the member's move one to Combat's move one.
  Set the member's move two to Combat's move two.
  Set the member's move three to Combat's move three.
  Set the member's move four to Combat's move four.
  Set the member's pp one to Combat's pp one.
  Set the member's pp two to Combat's pp two.
  Set the member's pp three to Combat's pp three.
  Set the member's pp four to Combat's pp four.

To restore a member (teammate):
  Set Combat's starter to the member's starter.
  Set Combat's species to the member's species.
  Set Combat's level to the member's level.
  Set Combat's experience to the member's experience.
  Set Combat's health to the member's health.
  Set Combat's maximum health to the member's maximum health.
  Set Combat's attack to the member's attack.
  Set Combat's defense to the member's defense.
  Set Combat's special to the member's special.
  Set Combat's speed to the member's speed.
  Set Combat's base speed to the member's base speed.
  Set Combat's move one to the member's move one.
  Set Combat's move two to the member's move two.
  Set Combat's move three to the member's move three.
  Set Combat's move four to the member's move four.
  Set Combat's pp one to the member's pp one.
  Set Combat's pp two to the member's pp two.
  Set Combat's pp three to the member's pp three.
  Set Combat's pp four to the member's pp four.

To work out the member (teammate, if any) at a slot (number):
  If the slot is less than 1 or the slot is more than 6 or the slot is not (the slot rounded down to the nearest 1):
    The answer is nothing.
  The answer is item the slot of the members.

To record:
  If Combat's starter is "":
    Stop.
  If Team's count is 0:
    Set Team's count to 1.
    Set Team's selected to 1.
  Let the found be the member at Team's selected.
  If the found is not nothing:
    Store the found.

To load a slot (number):
  Let the found be the member at the slot.
  If the found is not nothing:
    Restore the found.

To switch to a slot (number):
  Set Team's notice to "".
  If the slot is less than 1 or the slot is more than Team's count:
    Set Team's notice to "NO POKEMON".
    Stop.
  Record.
  Load the slot.
  If Combat's health is less than 1:
    Load Team's selected.
    Set Team's notice to "FAINTED".
    Stop.
  Set Team's selected to the slot.
  Set Combat's attack stage to 0.
  Set Combat's defense stage to 0.
  Set Team's notice to "READY".

To revive:
  Record.
  Let the former be Team's selected.
  Let the slot be 1.
  While the slot is at most Team's count:
    Set Team's selected to the slot.
    Load the slot.
    Heal.
    Record.
    Add 1 to the slot.
  Set Team's selected to the former.
  If Team's count is more than 0:
    Load the former.

To replace:
  Record.
  Set Team's result to "loss".
  Let the slot be 1.
  For each candidate in the members:
    If Team's selected is not the slot and Team's count is at least the slot and the candidate's health is more than 0:
      Switch to the slot.
      Set Team's result to "replacement".
      Stop repeating.
    Add 1 to the slot.
  If Team's result is "replacement":
    Set Combat's active to 1.
    Set Combat's outcome to "".
    Set Combat's message to "Go! {Combat's species}!".
    Stop.
  Heal.
  Record.
  Set Combat's outcome to "loss".

Let the high catch rate species be a list of "Nidoran F" and "Nidoran M".
Let the low catch rate species be a list of "Metapod" and "Kakuna".
Let the medium slow growth be a list of "Nidoran F", "Nidoran M" and "Pidgey".

To capture:
  Set Team's result to "".
  If Combat's active is 0 or Combat's foe is not "wild":
    Set Team's result to "trainer".
    Stop.
  Record.
  If Team's count is at least 6:
    Set Team's result to "full".
    Stop.
  Let the rate be 255.
  If Combat's opponent is "Pikachu":
    Set the rate to 190.
  If Combat's opponent is in the high catch rate species:
    Set the rate to 235.
  If Combat's opponent is in the low catch rate species:
    Set the rate to 120.
  Set Combat's seed to the remainder of (Combat's seed * 109 + 89) divided by 256.
  If Combat's seed is more than the rate:
    Set Team's result to "escaped".
    Stop.
  Let the divisor be (Combat's enemy health / 4) rounded down to the nearest 1.
  If the divisor is less than 1:
    Set the divisor to 1.
  Let the chance be (Combat's enemy maximum health * 255 / 12) rounded down to the nearest 1.
  Set the chance to (the chance / the divisor) rounded down to the nearest 1.
  If the chance is more than 255:
    Set the chance to 255.
  Set Combat's seed to the remainder of (Combat's seed * 109 + 89) divided by 256.
  If Combat's seed is more than the chance:
    Set Team's result to "escaped".
    Stop.
  Let the former be Team's selected.
  Add 1 to Team's count.
  Set Team's selected to Team's count.
  Set Combat's starter to Combat's opponent.
  Set Combat's level to Combat's enemy level.
  Set Combat's experience to Combat's level * Combat's level * Combat's level.
  If Combat's starter is in the medium slow growth:
    Set Combat's experience to ((6 * Combat's level * Combat's level * Combat's level / 5) rounded down to the nearest 1) - 15 * Combat's level * Combat's level + 100 * Combat's level - 140.
  Recalculate.
  Heal.
  Set Combat's health to Combat's enemy health.
  If Combat's health is more than Combat's maximum health:
    Set Combat's health to Combat's maximum health.
  Record.
  Set Team's selected to the former.
  Load the former.
  Set Combat's active to 0.
  Set Combat's outcome to "caught".
  Set Combat's message to "Caught {Combat's opponent}!".
  Set Team's result to "caught".






